edc1rawlayertdc05,500,3000.,4000.   $EDC1 raw tdc layer 05 x
edc1rawlayertdc06,500,3000.,4000.   $EDC1 raw tdc layer 06 xp
edc1rawlayertdc07,500,3000.,4000.   $EDC1 raw tdc layer 07 v
edc1rawlayertdc08,500,3000.,4000.   $EDC1 raw tdc layer 08 vp
edc1rawlayertdc09,500,3000.,4000.   $EDC1 raw tdc layer 09 x
edc1rawlayertdc10,500,3000.,4000.   $EDC1 raw tdc layer 10 xp

