edc2rawhitpat02,120,0.,120.         $EDC2 raw hitpat layer 02 up
edc2rawhitpat03,120,0.,120.         $EDC2 raw hitpat layer 03 x
edc2rawhitpat04,120,0.,120.         $EDC2 raw hitpat layer 04 xp
edc2rawhitpat05,120,0.,120.         $EDC2 raw hitpat layer 05 v
